@startuml
!include _style.iuml
allowmixing
left to right direction
title [Bản cũ – kiến trúc Servlet, đi kèm mã Java thử nghiệm] Biểu đồ giao tiếp mức thiết kế (MVC) – Approve and Export Order 0 (NV01 xuất DH1024, giao GH03)

actor "Sale Staff" as A
object ":SaleHomeView" as Home <<JSP>>
object ":OrderListView" as OLV <<JSP>>
object ":OrderDetailView" as ODV <<JSP>>
object ":DeliveryStaffListView" as DSV <<JSP>>
object ":InvoicePrintView" as IPV <<JSP>>
object ":OrderExportController" as Ctl <<Servlet>>
object ":InvoicePrintController" as PCtl <<Servlet>>
object ":OrderDAOImpl" as ODAO <<DAO>>
object ":OrderDetailDAOImpl" as DDAO <<DAO>>
object ":DeliveryStaffDAOImpl" as SDAO <<DAO>>
object ":ProductDAOImpl" as PDAO <<DAO>>
object ":InvoiceDAOImpl" as IDAO <<DAO>>
object ":Order" as Ord <<entity>>
object ":OrderDetail" as OD <<entity>>
object ":DeliveryStaff" as DS <<entity>>
object ":Invoice" as Inv <<entity>>

A --> Home : 1: click subBrowseOrder
Home --> OLV : 2: mở giao diện
A --> OLV : 3: chọn "Chưa xuất" + click subFilter\n9: click đơn DH1024
OLV --> Ctl : 4: doGet(action=list)\n10: doGet(action=detail, orderId)
Ctl --> ODAO : 5: getUnexportedOrders()\n11: getOrderById(orderId)\n18: approveOrder(orderId, staffId)\n19: getOrderById(orderId)\n30: assignDeliveryStaff(orderId, deliveryStaffId)\n31: getOrderById(orderId)\n36: exportOrder(orderId, staffId)\n40: getOrderById(orderId)
ODAO --> Ord : 6: new Order()
Ctl --> OLV : 7: forward(orders)
OLV --> A : 8: hiển thị danh sách đơn chưa xuất
ODAO --> DDAO : 12: getByOrder(orderId)
DDAO --> OD : 13: new OrderDetail()
Ctl --> ODV : 14: forward(order)\n20: forward(order, message)\n32: forward(order, message)\n41: forward(order, message)
ODV --> A : 15: hiển thị chi tiết đơn\n21: hiển thị "Đã duyệt"\n33: hiển thị nút xác nhận xuất\n42: "Xuất hàng thành công"
A --> ODV : 16: click subApprove\n22: click subAssignDelivery\n34: click subExport\n43: click subPrintInvoice
ODV --> Ctl : 17: doPost(action=approve)\n23: doGet(action=deliveryStaff)\n35: doPost(action=export)
Ctl --> SDAO : 24: getAvailableDeliveryStaff()
SDAO --> DS : 25: new DeliveryStaff()
Ctl --> DSV : 26: forward(deliveryStaffList)
DSV --> A : 27: hiển thị danh sách nhân viên giao hàng
A --> DSV : 28: chọn GH03 + click subSaveAssign
DSV --> Ctl : 29: doPost(action=assign)
ODAO --> PDAO : 37: checkStock(conn, details)\n38: decreaseStock(conn, details)
ODAO --> IDAO : 39: issueInvoice(conn, orderId, exportedAt)
ODV --> PCtl : 44: doGet(orderId)
PCtl --> IDAO : 45: getInvoiceByOrder(orderId)
IDAO --> Inv : 46: new Invoice()
IDAO --> DDAO : 47: getByOrder(orderId)
PCtl --> IPV : 48: forward(invoice)
IPV --> A : 49: hiển thị bản xem trước HD1024\n51: in hóa đơn
A --> IPV : 50: click subPrint
@enduml
